app.use((req, res, next) => {
  if (process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production' && !req.secure) {
    return res.status(400).json({ error: 'HTTPS required' });
  }
  next();
});
```

Usually HTTPS termination is handled at the ingress/load balancer, but app behavior should align with deployment architecture.

